• Central Government Schemes
Bank of Ideas and Innovations programme-in order to boost
innovative product companies.
Pradhan Mantri Micro Units Development and Refinance
Agency Limited (MUDRZ)- To extent benefits to 10 lakh small
and medium enterprises.
